# The viewer's own PRs quiet for over a month wait behind Mine's caption, which lists them after
# the rest when clicked and puts them away again when clicked once more.
wait settled
open lists
expect text "Mine (19)" exists
expect button "31 older than a month hidden" exists
snap mine-hidden

click button "31 older than a month hidden"
expect text "Mine (50)" exists
expect button "Hide 31 older than a month" exists
# The quietest come last.
scroll list 1 down 20000
wait until button ~"lily #895," in list 1 exists
snap mine-shown

click button "Hide 31 older than a month"
expect text "Mine (19)" exists
expect button "31 older than a month hidden" exists
